sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Trainer as Kubeflow Trainer<br/>Controller
    participant Kueue as Kueue<br/>Admission Controller
    participant CTR as ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>Registry
    participant Pod as Training Pod(s)<br/>distributed-workloads image
    participant Peer as Peer Training Pod(s)<br/>DDP/OpenMPI
    participant S3 as MinIO / S3<br/>(example only)

    Note over User,S3: Training Job Lifecycle

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
    K8sAPI->>Trainer: Watch event: TrainJob created
    Trainer->>CTR: Resolve runtime reference<br/>(e.g., torch-distributed, training-hub)
    CTR-->>Trainer: Container image + config<br/>(py312-cuda130-torch210-openmpi41)
    Trainer->>Kueue: Submit workload to LocalQueue
    Kueue->>Kueue: ClusterQueue admission check<br/>(quota, priority)
    Kueue-->>Trainer: Workload admitted
    Trainer->>K8sAPI: Create training pods<br/>(JobSet / PodGroup)
    K8sAPI->>Pod: Schedule pod(s)

    Note over Pod,Peer: Distributed Training Coordination

    alt OpenMPI Runtime
        Pod->>Peer: SSH connection<br/>Port 2222/TCP
        Pod->>Peer: MPI rank coordination<br/>OpenMPI 4.1
    else PyTorch DDP Runtime
        Pod->>Peer: torch.distributed rendezvous<br/>c10d backend
    else DeepSpeed Runtime
        Pod->>Peer: DeepSpeed launcher<br/>NCCL/RCCL backend
    end

    Pod->>Pod: Execute training workload<br/>(PyTorch, Transformers, TRL)

    opt Example Workloads Only
        Pod->>S3: Load training data<br/>S3 API / 9000/TCP
        Pod->>S3: Save checkpoints<br/>S3 API / 9000/TCP
    end

    Pod-->>K8sAPI: Pod completes (Success/Failure)
    K8sAPI-->>Trainer: Job status update
    Trainer-->>User: TrainJob status: Succeeded

    Note over User,S3: Universal Image Dual-Mode

    alt Workbench Mode (NOTEBOOK_ARGS set)
        User->>K8sAPI: Create Workbench (Notebook CR)
        K8sAPI->>Pod: Launch with NOTEBOOK_ARGS env
        Pod->>Pod: entrypoint-universal.sh<br/>→ start-notebook.sh
        Pod-->>User: Jupyter interface available
    else Training Mode (no NOTEBOOK_ARGS)
        Trainer->>K8sAPI: Create training pod
        K8sAPI->>Pod: Launch with controller CMD override
        Pod->>Pod: entrypoint-universal.sh<br/>→ controller-provided command
    end
